# ===== Aetheria Grand Prix - cai dat may chu =====
# run.mjs tu chep file nay thanh ".env" o lan chay dau. Windows: bam dup start-server.cmd,
# chuong trinh se hoi token va tu ghi vao .env.
# File .env chua bi mat: dung gui cho nguoi khac, dung dua len git (.gitignore da loai no ra).

# 1) TOKEN CLOUDFLARE TUNNEL (chuoi dai bat dau bang eyJ...), dan vao sau dau "=".
#    Lay o: Cloudflare dashboard -> Zero Trust -> Networks -> Tunnels -> chon tunnel -> Configure
#    -> "Install and run a connector". Co the dan ca dong lenh o do, chuong trinh tu loc lay token.
#    Ghi off neu may nay da chay cloudflared dang service cho dung tunnel do (se khong hoi token nua).
TUNNEL_TOKEN=

# 2) Dia chi nguoi choi se mo. Phan duong dan (/game) la noi game duoc gan vao.
PUBLIC_URL=https://vuducan.qzz.io/game/
BASE_PATH=/game

# 3) Cong noi bo cua game. Trong tunnel (tab Public Hostname) dat Service = http://localhost:3000
PORT=3000
# 127.0.0.1 = chi vao duoc qua tunnel (nen dung). Doi thanh 0.0.0.0 neu muon may trong mang LAN vao truc tiep.
HOST=127.0.0.1
